1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,141
Benny: Ham? Or turkey? Ham. Or… TURKEY?!

2
00:00:02,650 --> 00:00:06,491
Oona: You've been staring at that fridge for 40 minutes.

3
00:00:05,350 --> 00:00:08,015
Benny: What if I pick the wrong one?!

4
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:09,015
Oona: Okay. More options.

5
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:13,682
Benny: 30 sandwiches?!

6
00:00:13,550 --> 00:00:15,274
Oona: Just pick one.

7
00:00:15,050 --> 00:00:17,066
Benny: But what if number 29 is better?

8
00:00:17,850 --> 00:00:19,162
Benny: 3,000?!

9
00:00:20,250 --> 00:00:21,938
Oona: That one's the special.

10
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:23,429
Benny: Too many!

11
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,429
Benny: Too many!

12
00:00:23,560 --> 00:00:24,430
Benny: Too—

13
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:24,430
Benny: TOO—

14
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:29,259
Benny: …Oh. It's perfect.

15
00:00:28,850 --> 00:00:31,750
Oona: It's egg salad. From last Tuesday.

16
00:00:31,900 --> 00:00:34,212
Benny: I didn't have to choose.

17
00:00:33,650 --> 00:00:38,079
Oona: More choices. Less happy. It's called the paradox of choice.

18
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,771
Oona: You coming home, or what?

19
00:00:40,550 --> 00:00:42,430
Benny: Home has 2 sandwiches.
